<opsproc code="00012898.0007001" revdate="2018-08-01T16:29:10"><title><abb>ACT</abb> Transfer Valve</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.001"><title>On ground or in flight</title><procbody lid="N.00012898.0007001.002"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00012898.0007001.001" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.003" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro> If the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>FUEL</ecamsys><ecamtitle> L(R) WING TK OVERFLOW</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert is displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb>:</intro><procbody lid="N.00012898.0007001.004"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.005"><para code="00012898.0007001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.006">When the ECAM procedure requires to set <tech-label type="pb-sw">ALL ACT</tech-label> to
ISOL, the action on the pb-sw will not isolate the <abb>ACT</abb> as
the <abb>ACT</abb> transfer valve is failed open.</para><para code="00012898.0007001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.007">In order to isolate all the <abb>ACT</abb>s, the following actions
have to be performed:</para></inform><action-block lid="N.00012898.0007001.008"><action layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.009" memory="false"><cr-action code="00012898.0007001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ACT XFR</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.010" memory="false"><cr-action code="00012898.0007001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ACT XFR MODE
SEL</tech-label></challenge><response>MAN</response></cr-action></action></action-block><condition at-any-time="false" code="00012898.0007001.006" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.011" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>When <abb>CTR</abb> <abb>TK</abb> fuel quantity reaches <measure category="Weight" show-unit="true" system="SI and derived" unit="t">3</measure> :</intro><procbody lid="N.00012898.0007001.012"><action layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.013" memory="false"><command code="00012898.0007001.007"><para layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.014">Apply <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>FUEL</ecamsys><ecamtitle>ACT XFR FAULT</ecamtitle></ecam-data> procedure</para></command></action></procbody></condition><condition at-any-time="false" code="00012898.0007001.008" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.015" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>When <abb>CTR</abb> <abb>TK</abb> is empty</intro><procbody lid="N.00012898.0007001.016"><action layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.017" memory="false"><command code="00012898.0007001.009"><para layer="1" lid="N.00012898.0007001.018">Resume <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>FUEL</ecamsys><ecamtitle>L(R) WING TK OVERFLOW</ecamtitle></ecam-data> procedure</para></command></action></procbody></condition></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>